{
  "name" : "Chrobak2011 - A mathematical model of induced cancer-adaptive immune system competition",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model describing competition between an artificially induced tumor and the adaptive immune system based on the use of an autonomous system of ordinary differential equations.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
    "name" : "SBML",
